WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
The year 610.

2
00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.890
An Irish abbot is taken
under guard to Nantes,

3
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.640
to be shipped home.

4
00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.420
A king has ordered him out of the kingdom.

5
00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:14.370
He had refused to bless the king's
sons, brought to him by Queen Brunhild.

6
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:20.020
Later he would write to a pope, urging him
to clear himself of suspicion of heresy.

7
00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:25.380
So how did one Irish monk end up
defying a queen and lecturing a pope?

8
00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:29.470
In this mission, you'll follow
Columbanus from Bangor to Burgundy,

9
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.220
and on into Italy.

10
00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:34.400
Then you'll read his rules
and letters, and ask:

11
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.750
prophet or troublemaker?

12
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:41.950
Your mission: find out how this monk
came to defy a queen and lecture a pope.
